('call-recording','Call Recording','Keep the conversation, not just the outcome.','Call recording is included in Dialnytics plans. Record only when the required notices and permissions are in place.', [('Included, not an extra subscription','Recording is part of the confirmed plan feature set. Ask the team to demonstrate the recording controls during your guided demo.',['Included in every listed plan','Recording controls in the dialer','Review recordings as part of your team workflow']),('Use recordings responsibly','Recording is not the same as consent. Confirm the rules that apply to the participants and your business, and avoid recording unnecessary sensitive information.',['Tell participants where required','Limit access to authorised staff','Confirm retention and storage arrangements before activation'])]),
('campaigns','Power Dialer','Turn a lead list into a focused calling session.','Build a queue from selected CRM leads, move through eligible numbers and keep notes with each queue call.', [('Work through the right leads','Choose leads rather than dial every imported record. The calling workflow checks lead consent and Do Not Call status.',['Selected-lead queues','Start, pause, continue and skip controls','Call notes and outcomes']),('Keep control of the session','Power Dialer is included in the plan. It is a guided calling workflow, not a promise of predictive or parallel calling.',['Review each lead before contacting','Record the result after a conversation','Respect opt-outs immediately'])]),
('scripts','Call Scripts','Give your team a useful starting point.','Keep a consistent introduction, qualification questions and next steps available while handling calls.', [('Prepare a conversation, not a monologue','Write a short opening and the facts your team must not miss. Use questions that leave room for the customer to respond.',['Opening and identity','Reason for the call','A clear next action']),('Keep scripts accurate','Review scripts when offers or contact details change. Do not impersonate another organisation or make promises your business cannot meet.',['Use approved product information','Keep pricing consistent','Record genuine customer requirements'])]),
